(2) The paper estimates the ATE of the form:
\begin{equation}
\tau = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i = 1}^{n} y_i(1, 1) - \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i = 1}^{n} y_i(0, 0).
\end{equation}
Is it possible to estimate the effect of the treatment itself, excluding the influence of the exposure?

